## KEY TECHNICAL DECISIONS

| Decision | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| LLM | Groq `openai/gpt-oss-120b` | 1000 RPM, no daily limit; Gemini had 20 RPD free limit |
| STT | expo-speech-recognition | Real live transcription, on-device Google, no cloud cost |
| Wake word | Sherpa-ONNX KWS (Apache 2.0) | Fully offline, no account, no expiry, ~5 MB model |
| DB | PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector | Structured queries + semantic vector search |
| WS transport | Raw WebSocket (WSS) | Lower overhead than SocketIO for voice |
| LLM client | langchain_openai.ChatOpenAI with openai_api_base override | Groq is OpenAI-API compatible |
| Provider pattern | USE_MOCK_DATA=true/false | Swap mock↔live Graph API without code change |
| APK type | Release (signed debug keystore) | Internal distribution |
| Server URL | Hardcoded binary constant, never in UI | Security: colleagues install, nothing reveals domain |

## INTENT ROUTING (7 intents)

| Intent | Trigger keywords | Agent node |
|---|---|---|
| `calendar_query` | meeting, calendar, schedule, agenda, today, week, tomorrow | `calendar_agent` |
| `action_items` | action, task, todo, follow-up, overdue | `action_items_agent` |
| `memory_search` | remember, search, transcript, what did, who said, budget, review | `memory_agent` |
| `schedule_meeting` | book, create meeting, set up | `general_agent` |
| `availability_query` | free, available, busy, slot, open slot | `availability_agent` |
| `email_query` | email, inbox, mail, unread | `email_agent` |
| `general` | anything else | `general_agent` (Groq direct) |

LLM classifies intent; keyword heuristic fallback fires when LLM quota is hit.
DB queries (calendar, action_items) never need LLM — they work in full heuristic mode.

## LLM FACTORY (_make_llm in supervisor.py)

Priority chain (tries each in order, returns first that has a key):
1. Groq (`GROQ_API_KEY`) — ChatOpenAI with openai_api_base="https://api.groq.com/openai/v1"
2. Gemini (`GOOGLE_API_KEY`) — ChatGoogleGenerativeAI, max_retries=0, request_timeout=12
3. None → heuristic-only mode (all DB queries still work; general queries get honest error)

