    - Restart: cd /root/jarvis && docker compose up -d backend
    - Test: curl https://utilsnow.com/jarvis/health (should show mock_mode: false)

TEAMS-SIDE SETTING (Teams Admin Center — separate from Azure Portal):
  - Go to: https://admin.teams.microsoft.com
  - Meetings → Meeting policies → (policy assigned to the user)
  - Enable: "Allow cloud recording" = On
  - Enable: "Allow transcription" = On
  - Without this, CallRecords and Transcript APIs return empty even with permissions

OPTIONAL GUID (7ce5db77-da43-4bf5-a033-0083db78c2b8):
  - Tested against Graph API: returns 404 ErrorInvalidUser
  - Not a valid user object in this tenant; may be a service principal or object from a different tenant
