### NGINX FIX APPLIED (2026-10-11)

Fixed: /jarvis/api/ proxy was routing to http://127.0.0.1:8001/ (dropped /api/ prefix)
       → all REST endpoints returned 404 from public URLs
Fix:   Changed proxy_pass to http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/
Now:   /jarvis/api/meetings, /jarvis/api/action-items, /jarvis/api/people all return 200

